        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Fails or refuses within ten (10) calendar days to respond affirmatively to University inquiries concerning the employee's desire to return to work. The ten-calendar-day response period shall begin immediately upon personal notice or from the date written notice is served (as indicated in the Proof of Service), whichever is sooner; or",
